ogue where the movie has a bunch of  different endings  that's mostly fine but including an  entire 10 minute scene from the  nightmare premonition  instead of just a small teaser was a bit  much  especially since the movie is 4 hours  long  then after that zack snyder for some  reason throws martian hunter in a really  awkward scene where batman doesn't even  want to be talking to him  i'm sorry who are you again it's just a  really weird way to end the movie and i  would say this is partially devoid of  logic on a creator's standpoint  besides it just being fan service but  yeah that's basically it  i thought the movie was pretty fun but  it is weighed down by a lot of  exposition and origin stories if the  mother boxes and the antagonists were  already established like with the  infinity stones and thanos  then i think this movie would have a  much easier job in telling its story  because they have a lot of leg work to  do in terms of exposition  so yeah let me know what you thought  about the movie in the comments and if  you like this video then check out my  other devoid of logic videos in the end  screen

